        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 800AN, Arlington Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis solid brass handleset made by Kwikset has a lifetime mechanical warranty. Very sleek in design, the Arlington single cylinder door entrance set features beveled edges at the top and the bottom with a classic grip handle. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets. The deadbolt on this single cylinder handleset is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn lever on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n<a href=\"/products/arlington-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802an\"><b>Arlington Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Arlington Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 800AN Arlington Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 19-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arlington Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 800AN",
